5. Implementing the `/set_secret` and `/get_secret` endpoints to manage user secrets, ensuring that only authenticated users can access their secrets.
6. Ensuring all endpoints return responses that conform to the specified OpenAPI schema and handle errors appropriately.
7. Starting the FastAPI application on `0.0.0.0:5000` to make it accessible.

The implementation will prioritize security by validating inputs, managing sensitive data through environment variables, and ensuring safe database interactions.

